WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:03.133
-We have exactly 10 shows before
we go on Christmas break, which

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:05.167
means it's time for that beloved
"Tonight Show" tradition.

00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:07.434
It's time for
"12 Days of Christmas Sweaters."

00:00:07.434 --> 00:00:08.601
Here we go.

00:00:08.601 --> 00:00:10.901
♪ -12 days of
Christmas sweaters ♪

00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:15.133
♪ 10 days left ♪

00:00:15.133 --> 00:00:16.467
-That's right.

00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:19.000
Every show between now and
Christmas, we'll be giving

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.434
one lucky audience member
an outrageous Christmas sweater.

00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:23.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:23.501 --> 00:00:25.734
From the Countdown to Christmas
cabinet.

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:29.901
Now, since there are 10 shows
left, let's open door number 10.

00:00:29.901 --> 00:00:31.968
Here we go.
-Well, actually, actually,

00:00:31.968 --> 00:00:34.834
I thought, you know, before we
open it, that we actually

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:37.501
talk to the audience and see if
you guys have any questions

00:00:37.501 --> 00:00:40.901
about the show, how it's made
or anything about me.

00:00:40.901 --> 00:00:42.801
-Doreen, Doreen.
It's time for the sweaters.

00:00:42.801 --> 00:00:44.667
Here we go.
Let's do the sweaters.

00:00:44.667 --> 00:00:46.100
Here we go, number 10.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:48.400
Whenever you're ready, Doreen.
Go for it.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.334
Oh! Look at that right there.

00:00:50.334 --> 00:00:52.400
♪♪
Beautiful.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.968
Yeah, very nice.
It's a Christmas sweater.

00:00:54.968 --> 00:00:57.667
Ah, that is gorgeous.
Look at that.

00:00:57.667 --> 00:00:58.934
Claus.

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:00.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:00.634 --> 00:01:01.734
Wow!

00:01:01.734 --> 00:01:03.934
Want to turn it around?
Let's see it.

00:01:03.934 --> 00:01:06.400
Oh, it's a cardigan.
Oh, it's a cardigan!

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:09.601
[ Cheers and applause ]
Uh-oh!

00:01:09.601 --> 00:01:12.334
Now let's see who's going home
with tonight's sweater.

00:01:12.334 --> 00:01:13.868
Everyone,
look at your seat number.

00:01:13.868 --> 00:01:15.400
If I call your number,
come on down.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:17.300
Quest, can I get a drumroll,
please?

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:18.868
[ Drumroll ]

00:01:18.868 --> 00:01:20.300
Who wants a sweater?!

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:23.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:26.267
3-1-4!

00:01:26.267 --> 00:01:28.868
♪♪

00:01:28.868 --> 00:01:30.734
Yeah, yeah, come on!

00:01:30.734 --> 00:01:33.133
♪♪

00:01:33.133 --> 00:01:36.267
Yeah, put the bag down!

00:01:36.267 --> 00:01:38.968
Get rid of that bag!
Get down here!

00:01:38.968 --> 00:01:41.200
♪♪

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:44.267
Oh! Welcome!

00:01:44.267 --> 00:01:46.100
Congratulations.

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:48.367
Thank you very much
for being here.

00:01:48.367 --> 00:01:49.467
Congratulations.

00:01:49.467 --> 00:01:50.734
What is your name?

00:01:50.734 --> 00:01:52.234
-Karen Sellers.
-Karen.

00:01:52.234 --> 00:01:54.367
Where are you from, Karen?
-Centennial, Colorado.

00:01:54.367 --> 00:01:56.167
-Colorado!

00:01:56.167 --> 00:01:58.701
It just started to snow
in Colorado.

00:01:58.701 --> 00:02:00.434
-No, it happened in Hawaii.

00:02:00.434 --> 00:02:02.701
-It's perfect timing.

00:02:02.701 --> 00:02:05.434
Can you try on the sweater?
Would you like the try it on?

00:02:05.434 --> 00:02:07.000
-Yes.
-I think we all love it.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:08.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:08.501 --> 00:02:10.467
This is going to be great.
Karen, it's perfect.

00:02:10.467 --> 00:02:12.501
I could already tell.

00:02:12.501 --> 00:02:14.000
Doreen, help when you can.

00:02:15.267 --> 00:02:17.234
Oh, oh, oh, wow!

00:02:17.234 --> 00:02:18.801
Look at this! Come on!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:18.801 --> 00:02:20.367
Ohhh!

00:02:20.367 --> 00:02:23.067
You're a supermodel.
It looks fantastic!

00:02:23.067 --> 00:02:24.567
Thank you so much!

00:02:24.567 --> 00:02:26.267
Congratulations to our winner.
Stick around.

00:02:26.267 --> 00:02:28.300
We'll be talking to Jonah Hill
after the break.

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:30.100
Come on back, everybody.
You look great!

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:37.801
♪♪

